  },
  {
    "episode_id": 92596,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92596.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "The hardship over the past three years, it's complicated. And I think that what we were hearing on the ground, what I was hearing on the ground is people wanted the acknowledgement that life is hard. Things have been challenging. And they don't want people to just sort of falsely say it, it's that guy's fault. Therefore come over to my side. They want people who are acknowledging the hardship and recognizing that some of these problems that didn't start in the day can't be solved in a day. And so, you know, it was interesting to watch even election night. I won't name names, but I think they know who they are. Election night, one of the prominent reporters was",
