    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92596.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 14,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, the analogy that's often used is, well, you can't call the final result of the game when you're still in the first quarter.",
