        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Audiences interpret incremental data through a narrative of competition even when inappropriate.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The public expects real-time updates to reflect actual progress toward final results.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Media coverage contributes to reinforcing the false perception of a race.",
