    "turn_text": "Well, and I think it's the system that we should have. I mean, we have a common background at CIA. And if you look back to kind of my whole experience that I remember when I was going out and going to go meet with an asset and I had a plan for what I was supposed to do. Like I would sit down with my chief of operations or my chief of station, say this is my plan. And then they would kind of try to poke holes in my plan. Or did you think about this? Did you think about that?",
