    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92596.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 97,
    "turn_text": "So the United States Postal Inspection Service is really one of the best federal law enforcement agencies out there. that nobody really knows about them because it's an entire cadre of people that do incredibly good work, incredibly detailed investigations, and don't necessarily get any notoriety for it. My favorite thing about having been a postal inspector is any event I go to where there's uh, former, uh, Department of Justice, uh, assistant U.S. attorneys, when they find out I was a",
