    "turn_idx": 118,
    "turn_text": "Sure. I know better than to ask you the details of the operation that went wrong or the worst case you ever handled. But I always get in a different way, which is what lessons did you learn from the thing that most went wrong? during your operational career. What was it that you took away and said, okay, there's something I did or something I was a part of that led to a situation that was suboptimal. Here's something that I'm going to do better in the future.",
