    "turn_idx": 124,
    "turn_text": "that, you know, obviously, you know, when something goes wrong, you want to have an after action, you want to make sure like what were the things that we missed and where could we have done better and Where could we have avoided this issue? Or if the issue was unavoidable, could it have been kind of a smaller level issue, if you will? But then even with things that go right, well, you know, could they have been better?",
