    "turn_text": "That's one of the tough ones where people seem to be so dug in on their positions, either, well, it's entirely a border control issue, or it's entirely a domestic issue that getting people to understand, no, it can be both, right? That it doesn't, and not every issue has to be an either or issue. Maybe there are multiple solutions and we can reinforce the overall effort by hitting those separate solutions. I wonder how much of this goes to... I don't want to blame Hollywood for things. That's too dramatic, but we talked before with many of our guests about how on intelligence and national security issues that fiction does not do a good job of helping the American people understand the issues out there, whether it's what an actual operations officer does. My guess is you did not spend most of your time running around in tight dresses and high heels, shooting people, having car chases and throwing bombs.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
